msgstr "文件停滞多久后搁置（秒）"

#: big-storage-rescue/usr/lib/big-storage-rescue/gui/pages/rescue.py:1028
msgid "A file that does not advance for this long is set aside, so that the others are saved first. 0: never."
msgstr "在此时长内没有进展的文件会被搁置，以便先保存其他文件。0：从不。"

